PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, the county&rsquo;s middle value hit 177% of normal in June to July and fell to 52% of normal in September to October. Grid 15131 had its driest year in 2005 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
